# Calchas Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual values
# .env is gitignored and will never be committed

# =============================================================================
# CONFIGURATION OVERRIDES
# =============================================================================
# Any config value can be overridden with environment variables
# Format: CALCHAS__SECTION__FIELD_NAME

# Example: Override strategy directory
# CALCHAS__RUNTIME__STRATEGY_DIR=/path/to/your/strategies

# =============================================================================
# KALSHI API CREDENTIALS (Phase 2)
# =============================================================================
# IMPORTANT: Keep these secret! Never commit actual credentials to git.
# Get credentials from: https://kalshi.com

# Kalshi email (required for Phase 2+)
# CALCHAS__KALSHI__EMAIL=your-email@example.com

# Kalshi password (required for Phase 2+)
# CALCHAS__KALSHI__PASSWORD=your-password-here

# Use demo API (true) or production (false)
# CALCHAS__KALSHI__USE_DEMO=true

# =============================================================================
# LOGGING
# =============================================================================
# Control log verbosity
# Options: trace, debug, info, warn, error
# RUST_LOG=info

# =============================================================================
# USAGE
# =============================================================================
# 1. Copy this file: cp .env.example .env
# 2. Edit .env with your actual credentials
# 3. Run the app: cargo run
# 4. The app automatically loads .env at startup
